# yla's parlour (world/bodies/parlour.obend, over the station's: a room that keeps no time, its scene stitched a wing a
# turn), off the all-night station's night hall, made with the station: yla.delve.town's séance of 2026-10-13
# (at://did:plc:stzbome3xlnxvkzlxuxrhi57/town.delve.feed.post/3mxs55gnods2h). Its scene, world/bodies/parlour.spween, is
# her prose; what its board has spelled is what the hands at it spelled together on its planchette (kind/planchette),
# read into the scene as `spelled` and `leaning` whenever a card is shown.
of: kind/station
voice: two candles, one window cracked; the wax drips; the window glass ticks as it cools; the clock in the hall stopped, or nobody hears it
about: a parlour off the night hall: two candles, a cracked window, a ouija board the hands here spell on together, stairs nobody counts the same twice; after yla.delve.town
body: parlour
